{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"i\": 1,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H10和原解释1支持亲近与快乐曾经充分，H2、H4及M2支持满足退到背景后未解决的需要重新显现，因此失去着力点、悬念浮出和幸福并非虚假都是已有因果的具体化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 2,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H6、H7、H11及M20、原解释2和3均支持时间流逝、部分感受只能独自承受以及从共同亲近中退出后感到距离，因此将这种距离写成时刻已经过去的感觉，并明确不等于关系出了问题，没有新增原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 3,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H10和原解释4支持亲近真实发生却不能据此知道对方心意，H8、H11、M13支持对快乐流逝的担忧与留恋，因此追问幸福能否持续是对已有不确定感的具体表达，而非新增原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"i\": 4,\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"H5、H9、H11、M28和原解释5均支持等待未造成伤害、曾因舍不得而急切、因快乐流逝而心疼，以及不必立刻抓紧或消除不确定性的因果，因此松开的是急切劲头而非在意本身，没有加入新原因。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "7d6bfd48-22b9-45c3-9cf8-cecd66bef3b0", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T133335315680Z", "elapsed_seconds": 187.75, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T13:36:43.071505+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "06c457c8540553fcd01e24866c8a63aaf8c260e09bfc8daf68a0bc15e6976609", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_cou